{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Accidental Humanitarians"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Thinking of Others"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "  Understand detailed descriptions of real or imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to contribute"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to help, either financially or with service"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We'll the first step is to decide how you can contribute to our project."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob04aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about a new volunteering position."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "event planning "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the act of organizing events like weddings or other ceremonies"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you have any experience with event planning?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fundraising"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the act of raising money for a charity or humanitarian cause"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here at home the focus is on fundraising."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "drive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short fundraising effort"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This year we are also going to branch out by attempting a few new drives."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "auction"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a public sale where people bid (offer money) on items"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Well our traditional method is hosting benefits like auctions, golf tournaments and concerts."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to crowdfund"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "  to raise money for a project by getting a small donation from a large amount of people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "\uff08verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are going to crowdfund a medical center."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ethical"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "morally right"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We also want to promote the sale of what we call \u201cethical gifts\u201d."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob04aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le07ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Linking: Consonant + Vowel"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Linking is very common in natural conversation. Linking happens when certain sounds are connected. This happens between function words and content words. It also happens particularly when there is a consonant at the end of one word and a vowel at the beginning of the next."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Just a moment ... <br/> You pronounce this as: <span class=\"strong\">Just_a </span>moment"}, {"type": "text", "content": "This linking pattern not only joins two words, but can also link three or more words together<br/>For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "My dog is a ... <br/>You pronounce this as: My <span class=\"strong\">dog_iz_a</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read these sentences aloud slowly and then more quickly, focusing on linking the consonant and vowel sounds together."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">thought it </span>might."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'll the first <span class=\"strong\">step is </span>to decide how you can contribute to our project."}, {"type": "example", "content": "But here at home the<span class=\"strong\"> focus is </span>on fundraising."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exciting,<span class=\"strong\"> but ambitious</span>."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Intonation and Lists"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Intonation is the rise and fall of your voice. There are definite and expected intonation patterns in English.  The more you practice listening to and saying the correct intonation patterns, the better you will understand and be understood."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When naming items in a list, you use rising intonation for the first item in the list and falling intonation for the last. Falling intonation indicates the end of the list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I like bananas \u2934, apples \u2934, pears \u2934 and grapes \u2935. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The rising intonation indicates to the listener that you are not finished and that there are other items in the list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying these sentences from the dialogue:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "As I've told you in Lesotho we focus on health, homes and jobs. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Well our traditional method is hosting benefits like auctions, golf tournaments and concerts."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Well, I'm a life coach, so I really excel at things like motivation, introspection and communication."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have a great deal of experience with planning, organizing and delivering workshops and conferences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a famous humanitarian (Mother Teresa, Bill Gates, etc.)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online and research their life and humanitarian deeds."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create a mock interview with at least 10 questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Act out the interview with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research a famous humanitarian."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write an interview with a humanitarian."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I act out the interview with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le07ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le07ob04re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le07ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: Welcome back, Amy. I'm so glad you will be joining our team!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Thanks, I'm really looking forward to it. My experience at the soup kitchen really confirmed my belief that we need to think of others.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: I thought it might. Well, the first step is to decide how you can contribute to our project. What skills can you offer us?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span> : I'm a life coach, so I really excel at things like motivation, introspection and communication.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le07ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: Sounds like you're a real people-person. Do you have any experience with event planning?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Well, I run my own business, of course, so I have a great deal of experience with planning, organization and delivering workshops and conferences.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: That's precisely what we need. As I've told you in Lesotho we focus on health, homes and jobs, but here at home the focus is on fundraising.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: How do you go about it?", "id": 2, "time": "25000", "image": "engenn10le07ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: Well our traditional method is hosting benefits like auctions, golf tournaments and concerts. This year we are also going to branch out by attempting a few new drives. We are going to crowdfund a medical center, but we also want to promote the sale of what we call \u201cethical gifts\u201d.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Wow, that's really ambitious. Exciting, but ambitious.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: It is, but we believe that if we can get enough donors, we can make it happen. We believe that if we combine these strategies under the direction of one motivated individual, we can reach our targets.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: And that's where I come in, I guess.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: Exactly, I'd like to see you hosting your first event as early as next month.", "id": 3, "time": "49500", "image": "engenn10le07ob04re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about social issues and moral dilemmas. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can link final consonants to beginning vowels. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can use proper intonation in lists."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What skills would you bring to a volunteering position?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What skills could you improve by volunteering?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Pronunciation Spot: Let's find out how Amy hopes to contribute!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nAmy <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">takes the plunge</span>.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "tips", "content": [{"tip_id": 0, "type": "text", "content": " To <span class=\"italic\">\"take the plunge\"</span> means to make up your mind to do something."}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.\n"}]}], "template_override": 1}, {"questi